  "content": {
    "title": "关于召开2021年度流动党员支部组织生活会和开展民主评议党员的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2022-02-17",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;按照</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">省</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">教育厅直属机关委员会《关于召开</span>2021<span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年度厅直属机关基层党组织组织生活会</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">和</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">开展民主评议党员的通知》文件精神，根据中心党总支具体要求，现就召开流动党员支部组织生活会和开展民主评议党员有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一、总体要求</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">要深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，紧紧围绕党的十九届六中全会精神，汲取党的百年奋斗历史经验，弘扬伟大建党精神，坚定不移把坚决拥护</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">两个确立</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">作为最高政治原则，满怀激情创造新业绩、绘就新篇章、谱写新辉煌。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、方法步骤</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.<span style=\"font-family:楷体\">强化理论学习。</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">广大流动党员要把学习贯彻党的十九届六中全会精神作为当前和今后一个时期的重大政治任务，吃透基本精神，把握核心要义，明确实践要求，激励担当作为。把学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想作为看家本领、立身之本、头等大事，更好地以理论清醒保证政治坚定，以思想提升引领事业进步。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.<span style=\"font-family:楷体\">广泛征求意见。</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">通过座谈、谈话、发放征求意见表等形式，主动征求身边群众的意见建议，把问题谈开、把思想谈透。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.<span style=\"font-family:楷体\">深入问题查摆。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">要</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">抓好问题查摆整改，严肃认真开展批评和自我批评，打扫政治灰尘，净化政治灵魂，达到坚持真理、修正错误，统一意志、增进团结的目的。认真撰写对照检查材料，把自己摆进去、把工作摆进去，列出问题清单和整改措施。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 三、相关要求</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">流动党员支部支委会</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">拟定于</span>2022<span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">24</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日（星期四）</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">14</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">：</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">00</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">在中心</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">501</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">会议室召开。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">因疫情原因，广大流动党员要</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">围绕主题</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">就近就便参加组织生活会，</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">谈认识</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">、</span></span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">讲体会，对照要求查摆问题和短板，做好自检自查，落实整改。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">请于</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">23</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日（星期三）前，将组织生活会对照检查材料和参加组织生活会场景的图片发送至指定邮箱。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3.</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">联系方式：</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 电话：</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">0431-84657570</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 邮箱：</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">33058746@qq.com</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;中共吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心流动党员支部</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2022<span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">17</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">日 </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n                ",
